#: src/ai/edit-prediction.md:3
msgid "Edit Prediction"
msgstr ""

#: src/ai/edit-prediction.md:5
msgid ""
"Edit Prediction is how Zed's AI code completions work: an LLM predicts the "
"code you want to write. Each keystroke sends a new request to the edit "
"prediction provider, which returns individual or multi-line suggestions that "
"can be quickly accepted by pressing `tab`."
msgstr ""

#: src/ai/edit-prediction.md:8
msgid ""
"The default provider is [Zeta, a proprietary open source and open dataset "
"model](https://huggingface.co/zed-industries/zeta), but you can also use "
"[other providers](#other-providers) like GitHub Copilot, Sweep, Mercury "
"Coder, and Codestral."
msgstr ""

#: src/ai/edit-prediction.md:10
msgid "Configuring Zeta"
msgstr ""

#: src/ai/edit-prediction.md:12
msgid ""
"To use Zeta, [sign in](../authentication.md#what-features-require-signing-"
"in). Once signed in, predictions appear as you type."
msgstr ""

